WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.632
Hi, I'm Pathbot.

00:00:02.832 --> 00:00:11.232
I help families plan college and careers. I help you make a simple plan, grade by grade, and find aid and scholarships.

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:17.960
For example, ask me: what should my tenth grader do this year to get ready for college?
